{
  "_why": "**還沒膠囊化的元件的節點性狀。只減不增。**\n一顆搬進膠囊時，這裡刪一列、`component.json` 的 `traits` 加一筆。\n⚠️ 三個不帶 `cpp:` 前綴的鍵（`number`／`string`／`boolean`）是**通用層的舊身分**，不是漏了前綴——原本的 `FOR_LOOP_CONCEPTS` 就同時列著兩套，照搬。",
  "traits": {
    "boolean": {
      "forLoopPart": true
    },
    "cpp:array_at": {
      "precedence": 16,
      "forLoopPart": true
    },
    "cpp:include": {
      "scaffold": true,
      "includeDirective": true
    },
    "cpp:input": {
      "ioRole": "input",
      "ioStyle": "iostream"
    },
    "cpp:input_formatted": {
      "ioRole": "input",
      "ioStyle": "cstdio"
    },
    "cpp:print": {
      "ioRole": "print",
      "ioStyle": "iostream"
    },
    "cpp:print_formatted": {
      "ioRole": "print",
      "ioStyle": "cstdio"
    },
    "cpp:var_declare": {
      "forLoopPart": true
    },
    "cpp:var_ref": {
      "forLoopPart": true,
      "variableRef": true
    },
    "number": {
      "forLoopPart": true
    },
    "string": {
      "forLoopPart": true
    }
  }
}